*.p12
*.pfx

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# Test coverage
coverage/
lcov.info

# Test runner output (playwright / webdriver artifacts)
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.playwright/

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp

# 端脑在**本仓根目录**被起起来时留下的本地状态目录
# （`~/.local/share/shadow/{flows,identity}` —— 端脑用 `dirs` 库解析
#  `$HOME/.local`，而 HOME 恰好是这个仓根时就会长在这儿）。
# ⚠️ 它里面是**账号身份目录**（`account.key` / `device.id`）
# ⇒ `*.key` 规则挡住了私钥，但 `device.id` 会变成待提交文件
# ⇒ 整棵树按「本地状态」忽略掉。
.local/

# OpenCode
.opencode/

# 真机取证的产物（截图等）—— `scripts/prove-a2ui-on-device.ps1` 每次跑会重写
# ⇒ 不入库（文档里记的是**怎么复跑**，不是**当时的字节**）。
artifacts/

# Misc
*.bak
*.orig

# Isolated workspaces
.worktrees/

# tooling state
benchmark/.mimosa/
**/.mimosa/

# zcode local state
.zcode/

# benchmark runtime scratch (task workdirs + alternate target dirs
# used by the harness; regenerated per run, never source)
benchmark/.swe-work/
benchmark/.tau2/
benchmark/target-*/
benchmark/reports-*/
benchmark/runs-*traj/
